title: Day6_Hera_Intro
tags:
---
<<Scene new_dining_area>>
<<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" "left" "bottom" #674ea7>>
<<Act "Hera" "Hera" "right" "bottom" #008B8B>>
Hera: Aelius, good to see you again.

-> You as well, my Lady. (deference)
    Hera: You’ve been well, I hope?
    Aelius: Better every day. And you?
    Hera: Oh, fine.
    Hera: You know...
-> Heya, Hera. (humor)
    Hera: I'm not sure we're <i>quite</i> close enough for you to greet me like that.
    Aelius: My bad.
    Aelius: Was there something you wanted to say?
    Hera: Yes, actually...
-> Can I get your order? (aggressive)
    Hera: No small talk for you, I see. Swift and to the point!
    Aelius: Is that a bad thing?
    Hera: Oh, no. It makes sense...

Hera: Things have moved rather quickly since you showed up.
Aelius: I can slow my roll if that's a problem.
Hera: Oh, no! I would never ask such a thing. It has, by and large, been good.
Aelius: I'm gladd to hear it.
Aelius: So, are you hungry, or what?
Hera: Hm, yes.
Hera: I'll have the <i>Lotus Parfait</i>, if that's alright with you.
Aelius: Excellent choice.

// LOTUS PARFAIT
<<StartCooking "LotusParfait3">>
<<HideAll>>
===
title: Day6_Hera_ReturnPlayful
tags:
---
<<Scene new_dining_area>>
<<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" "left" "bottom" #674ea7>>
<<Act "Hera" "Hera" "right" "bottom" #008B8B>>

Aelius: Your parfait.
Hera: Delightful. Thank you, as always.
Aelius: [Positive] Of course. Have a nice meal.
Hera: Oh! Before you go…
Hera: You used to cook for your mother, yes?
Aelius: I... did, yeah.
Hera: Would you tell me about her?
Aelius: [Negative] ... Sure.

-> She cared about people.
    Aelius: She gave so much of herself for others.
    Aelius: And never asked for anything in return.
->  She always brightened the room.
    Aelius: Like...
    Aelius: She made things light without making light <i>of</i> things.
    Aelius: If that makes sense?
-> She was the strongest person I know.
    Aelius: Even up until the end...
    Aelius: She was the one comforting me.

Hera: ... Hm.
Hera: You take after her, then?
Aelius: [Negative] I... What?
Hera: You carry on in her honor.
Hera: Do you do it to make her proud?
Aelius: [Negative] I... didn’t even realize I was doing it.
Hera: Then you do it because she set a good example, and you knew in your heart to follow.
Aelius: [Negative] ...
Aelius: [Negative] Oh.
Hera: You were not doing it to make her proud. But I’m sure she would be.
Hera: I'm sure she <i>will</i> be. When you see her.
Aelius: Hah! Word travels fast.
Hera: I make it my business to keep up with the goings on of Mount Olympus.
Hera: It’s quite an exception being made for you, Aelius.
Hera: I hope you do not take it lightly.
Hera: And I hope your meeting with your mother is everything you’re hoping for.
Aelius: I appreciate that, Hera.
Hera: We appreciate you. Now, go help someone else.
Hera: The work is never done, love.
Aelius: Right, of course.
Aelius: Enjoy your meal.
<<HideAll>>
<<jump Day6_Hephaestus_Intro>>
===
